    "detailed_description": "<strong>Together Synergy is a 2 player local co-op game where one player controls the left wheel and the other player controls the right wheel.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive With A Friend!</h2>You take the left wheel and your friend takes the right wheel!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turning will be difficult!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557520/extras/acd1a9b4d586a8a943c0ad802edf9223.avif?t=1693506542\" /></span><br>The players must coordinate with each other to turn<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Right wheel goes backward and left wheel goes forward to turn right!<br></li><li>Left wheel goes backward and right wheel goes forward to turn right!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your character!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557520/extras/93a115ca2731237c9bc87135de4f3c85.avif?t=1693506542\" /></span><br>The game features many characters you can choose from!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clear the levels</h2>Together Synergy is a 3D platform game!<br><br><br><strong>Test you and your friends synergy together!</strong>",
